🤖 Android Library: `com.atlas:design-system:2.0.0`
📚 Storybook: storybook.atlas.design
🐙 GitHub: github.com/company/atlas-design-system"""

  def divider

  def callout "✅ Adoption: 87% of product surfaces now use Atlas (up from 34% in v1.0). Average design-to-dev time reduced from 3 weeks to 4 days."
    variant success
